# Later

Ideas, suggestions, and questions that are **not** in scope. This file exists so that a good
idea has somewhere to go other than into the project.

Record a nonblocking idea or issue once, then continue the current task. Do not invent
closeout questions to fill this file. Nothing moves from here into scope unless the author
asks for it in their own words, and then it becomes a decision in
`governance/decisions.yaml`.

Format: one line per item, newest at the top, with the date and where it came from.

